  "bodyHash": "33b1hNHUzvk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogI3PB2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1026\" height=\"369\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4bgOJ2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">神秘群系为我的世界主世界新增了7个生机勃勃的群系，每个群系都带来了新的植物、花朵、树木、木材种类以及动物，扩展了原版游戏体验。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">查看Wiki页面（<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>）以深入了解其更多特性！</p><p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9;font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>特性</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp; -&nbsp; 新增<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fStrawberry_Fields\" rel=\"nofollow\">草莓原野</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLavender_Meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">薰衣草草甸</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBamboo_Blossom_Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">竹花森林</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAutumnal_Grove\" rel=\"nofollow\">秋色小树林</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLush_Oasis\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁茂绿洲</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLagoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">潟湖</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTropics\" rel=\"nofollow\">热带地区</a>群系。</p><p>&nbsp; -&nbsp; 新增动物，如草莓牛、香草牛与巧克力牛、彩虹鸡、小熊猫、海獭和蝴蝶。</p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>1.20以下版本不再受支持，请勿询问相关内容。</strong></span></p><p><strong>1.18及以上版本需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a>。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:right\">始于2020年7月</p>",
